@identity = http://localhost:5086
@host = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{identity}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@licencias.local", "password": "1234*" }

### 2. Login catalog manager
# @name loginManager
POST {{identity}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "catalogmanager@licencias.local", "password": "1234" }

### 3. Login usuario normal
# @name loginUser
POST {{identity}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user@licencias.local", "password": "1234" }

### 4. Sin token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/vendors

### 5. Usuario normal -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 6. Catalog Manager puede listar -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 7. Catalog Manager NO puede crear -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Microsoft", "email": "ventas@microsoft.com", "phone": "6041234567" }

### 8. Admin crea proveedor -> 201
# @name createVendor
POST {{host}}/api/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Microsoft", "email": "ventas@microsoft.com", "phone": "6041234567" }

### 9. Proveedor inválido -> 400 con errores de validación
POST {{host}}/api/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "a", "email": "no-es-correo", "phone": "" }

### 10. Admin crea contrato (vence pronto) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "{{createVendor.response.body.$.id}}",
  "contractNumber": "CT-2026-001",
  "cost": 1500000,
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-05T00:00:00Z"
}

### 11. Contrato con proveedor inexistente -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "contractNumber": "CT-X",
  "cost": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-05T00:00:00Z"
}

### 12. Contratos por vencer en 30 días -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/contracts/expiring?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 13. days fuera de rango -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/contracts/expiring?days=0
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}